very film was  like that you you worked at available  time it's really you know just  discussions with with Matt and looking  at the film and looking at  every shot and saying this is what we  need this is what we have to go for and  if we had six more weeks it wouldn't  have been like they were six easy weeks  we would just keep doing the same thing  so that's that's what it's all about  you're just trying to make the most out  of the film in the time that you've got  am i correct at every spear in those  battle scenes every spear is not not  everyone but most okay yeah there's some  there there are the practical Spears  that are there so like when you have  spear riding the horse that's what we  called him his character's name is spear  but he's the guy who is riding that  horse and kind of cursed that with like  moment when he's like rearing up and  he's got that that's actually a stunt  guy riding with the spear and Weda  decided hey let's keep that spear cuz  that's a real thing you have try to have  as much so the horse is real and they  actually paint out the rider and then  put the a pin and so there's a bit of  something real and then there's  something totally created and it's this  whole magic of what they do  congratulations Matt Reeves and Jolla  Terry

